	(text "button (input + pull-up) works; to beep, D4 becomes a PWM output - it also sounds while START is held."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 186.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "678e8860-e72e-5eb6-ab1f-1c4e5f757d0e")
	)
	(text "1. POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7107dda4-7ae7-5a16-9168-3398594c9b0c")
	)
	(text "VBAT (D1 anode / J1 +) 3.6-4.8 V, VSYS = VBAT - 0.3 V (USB: 5 V), 3V3 = 3.3 V.  S1-S3: white low, black ~3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 303.53 271.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7a96fccc-64f6-5241-9f77-1a4e03e3a0df")
	)
	(text "Battery voltage is NOT measured: the XIAO has 3 ADC pins only (D0..D2) and the sensors use all of them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 54.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7d334055-709d-56cd-b1a8-34faded62e6c")
	)
	(text "IR LED: (3.3V - 1.2V - 0.1V) / 100 ohm = about 20 mA each.  Q1 switches all LEDs (ambient light cancel).  Photo transistor: 10k pull-up -> white = low voltage, black = high voltage"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7f315d56-1016-523f-9be8-a35ce8712d6b")
	)
	(text "The buzzer shares D4 with the START button (no free XIAO pin).  A piezo passes no DC, so reading the"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "86e9f14d-b891-5e4f-94a5-fa58be92e0f4")
	)
	(text "Q1: all IR LEDs on when SENS_LED_EN = 1 (about 60 mA)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 270.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a55691f3-d8b9-57e1-9f60-b12de5b2a87c")
	)
	(text "The body is 5.6 mm tall: the front of the robot is lifted by the 7.5 mm ball caster or skid (lens about 2.25 mm above the floor)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 209.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "acd6c292-ddd8-55dc-a359-ee458163ed72")
	)
	(text "Reset state (ESP32-C6 datasheet): GPIO18-23 weak pull-up during reset, then floating;"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ada16828-5a1a-5216-8a4b-ae8407a3a260")
	)
	(text "XIAO 5V pin = USB VBUS: an external supply needs a diode (D1), otherwise USB 5V charges the AA cells."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b55b5323-4e8b-5454-bfb4-d7c6f5bae914")
	)
	(text "GPIO16 (TX) / GPIO17 (RX) pull-up after reset + boot log / UART REPL -> no button and no motor input there."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 179.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b73b283f-bbc9-56c1-86e1-023c31ad0ea3")
	)
	(text "H/L fwd, L/H rev, H/H brake, L/L coast.  Over-current (ISD) latches OFF:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 92.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b9473c90-b62a-5b2f-b93b-f05dbe04c6c5")
	)
	(text "5. LINE SENSORS  3 x LBR-127HLD (mount on the BOTTOM side, lens to the floor), 12 mm apart"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d2036517-2b11-5a0d-96ea-32d7656f2a6b")
	)
	(text "toggle STBY L->H to recover (done by the library)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d2cc0148-41ce-5909-86d2-f1f9de12c7e3")
	)
	(text "On pin headers the XIAO sits 2.5 mm above the board: its bare bottom test pads can not touch the tracks."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ed616c66-e56e-5a98-8720-1c7667028ce3")
	)
	(text "Linetracer2 Lite rev.L3  :  XIAO ESP32C6 on pin headers, 3 x LBR-127HLD, 1 button, 1 buzzer, 6 RGB LEDs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 17.78 0)
